<!DOCTYPE html>
<html class="light" lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include('../partials/head') %>
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-surface-bright text-on-surface hf-dashboard">
    <% const applicantViewUser = typeof currentUser === 'object' && currentUser ? currentUser : {}; %>
    <% const displayName = applicantViewUser.fullName || 'Landlord'; %>
    <%- include('../partials/sidebar-landlord') %>

    <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 flex min-h-16 items-center justify-between border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface px-4 shadow-sm md:pl-[264px] md:pr-8">
      <div class="min-w-0">
        <p class="truncate text-label-sm font-bold text-secondary">Landlord workspace</p>
        <p class="truncate text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant"><%= displayName %></p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1 sm:gap-2">
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/landlord/notification-bell" aria-label="Notifications" title="Notifications"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">notifications</span></a>
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/landlord/messages" aria-label="Messages" title="Messages"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">chat_bubble</span></a>
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/landlord/settings" aria-label="Settings" title="Settings"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">settings</span></a>
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/landlord/user-profile" aria-label="Landlord profile" title="Landlord profile"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">person</span></a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="w-full px-4 py-6 md:ml-[240px] md:w-[calc(100%-240px)] md:px-8 md:py-8 hf-dashboard-main">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
        <div class="mb-8">
          <a class="mb-4 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 font-bold text-primary hover:underline" href="/user/landlord/applicants"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">arrow_back</span>Back to Applicants</a>
          <p class="mb-1 text-label-md font-bold text-secondary">Application detail</p>
          <h1 class="text-headline-lg font-bold text-primary">Applicant profile</h1>
          <p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Applicant information can appear here only after a renter submits a persisted, consented application to a saved listing.</p>
        </div>

        <section class="mb-8 border-y border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low px-5 py-6 sm:px-6" aria-labelledby="applicant-profile-status-title">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary text-on-primary" aria-hidden="true">person_search</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-label-sm font-bold uppercase text-secondary">Record status</p>
                <h2 id="applicant-profile-status-title" class="mt-1 text-headline-md font-bold text-primary">No application record selected</h2>
                <p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">No application identifier, persisted applicant record, consent grant, document access policy, or decision history is connected to this page.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="inline-flex min-h-11 shrink-0 items-center rounded-full bg-surface-container-high px-4 text-label-sm font-bold text-on-surface-variant">0 profile records</span>
          </div>
        </section>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 xl:grid-cols-12">
          <div class="space-y-8 xl:col-span-8">
            <section class="border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest px-6 py-10 text-center sm:px-8" aria-labelledby="empty-applicant-profile-title">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-5xl text-primary" aria-hidden="true">assignment_ind</span>
              <h2 id="empty-applicant-profile-title" class="mt-4 text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">Applicant details are unavailable</h2>
              <p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-2xl text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">This application does not have an authoritative renter, property, submission, score, document, activity, or review record to display.</p>
              <a class="mt-6 inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-primary px-5 font-bold text-on-primary hover:opacity-90" href="/user/landlord/applicants"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">groups</span>Open applicants</a>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="applicant-foundations-title">
              <div class="mb-4">
                <h2 id="applicant-foundations-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">Required application foundations</h2>
                <p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">A real applicant detail view must be backed by accountable records and access controls.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">key</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-on-surface">Record identity</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">A unique application tied to one saved listing, renter, submission version, and accountable status history.</p></article>
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">policy</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-on-surface">Authorization and consent</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Tenant-scoped access and an explicit allowlist of applicant fields and files consented for this review.</p></article>
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">fact_check</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-on-surface">Source and provenance</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Every verification, score input, document, timestamp, and status needs its source, freshness, and correction path.</p></article>
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">balance</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-on-surface">Accountable decisions</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Shortlist, viewing, offer, decline, and information requests need reasons, confirmation, delivery state, and audit history.</p></article>
              </div>
            </section>
          </div>

          <aside class="space-y-6 xl:col-span-4" aria-label="Applicant profile boundaries">
            <section class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-6" aria-labelledby="applicant-actions-title">
              <h2 id="applicant-actions-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-primary">Action availability</h2>
              <dl class="mt-4 divide-y divide-outline-variant text-body-sm">
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Message applicant</dt><dd class="font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Shortlist or compare</dt><dd class="font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Invite to viewing</dt><dd class="font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Offer or decline</dt><dd class="font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Review documents</dt><dd class="font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div>
              </dl>
            </section>

            <section class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-6" aria-labelledby="fair-review-title">
              <h2 id="fair-review-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-primary">Fair review boundary</h2>
              <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
                <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl text-primary" aria-hidden="true">check</span><span>Use only relevant information shared for the application.</span></li>
                <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl text-primary" aria-hidden="true">check</span><span>Never use HomiScore as the sole decision factor.</span></li>
                <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl text-primary" aria-hidden="true">check</span><span>Do not infer or rank protected characteristics.</span></li>
                <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl text-primary" aria-hidden="true">check</span><span>Keep decisions explainable, reviewable, and correctable.</span></li>
              </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="rounded-lg border border-error bg-error-container p-6" aria-labelledby="applicant-data-title">
              <h2 id="applicant-data-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-error-container">Protect applicant data</h2>
              <p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-error-container">Do not request identity files, bank details, passwords, or full application records through Contact or Messages while secure applicant sharing is unavailable.</p>
            </section>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
